abstract: >-
  SciPilot packages 15 specialised skills -- each a self-contained folder with
  a native SKILL.md prompt and a Python entry point -- that together cover the
  full CUMCM/MCM pipeline from problem analysis and data processing through
  model solving, validation, visualisation, paper writing and final review.
